msgctxt "#32217"
msgid "Watching"
msgstr "正在觀看"

msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "Trakt 附加元件也已啟用。兩個附加元件都會記錄播放並與 Trakt 同步，因此所有動作都會執行兩次。"

msgctxt "#32219"
